; Not a test. `dune build` compiles it so it cannot rot, and `dune runtest`
; never runs it: a benchmark is for answering a question someone asked, and a
; minute of every CI run spent on output nobody reads teaches people to ignore
; the suite.
;
;   dune exec bench/frame.exe
;
; It belongs to no package, exactly as examples/ does, so nothing installs it
; and the -p builds opam runs never see it.

(executable
 (name frame)
 (libraries camlcast_core camlcast bechamel))
